Common ContactResponsibility [526]
    documentation "The student's program contact responsibility information."
    descriptor ContactResponsibility [917]
        documentation "Indicates the contact responsibility being provided to the student by the program."
        is part of identity
    bool PrimaryIndicator [918]
        documentation "True if contact responsibility is a primary contact responsibility."
        is optional
    date ContactResponsibilityBeginDate [919]
        documentation "First date the student was in this option for the current school year.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    date ContactResponsibilityEndDate [920]
        documentation "Last date the student was in this option for the current school year.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional